  "description": "Ice, space, power, and wind. A continent guarded by witches who inherited the four Great Magic Stones. When the 7th generation who inherited \"Wind\" dies, summons are issued to select a successor,and the candidates gather at Winfred Academy. The disaster \"Erosion\" spreads. And Anzu, a boy who conceals the power of his cursed blood. Who did the wind choose? The story of Anzu, a boy who lives his life guided by the wind.\n\n(Source: Naver, translated)",
